  "bio": "Alex Rae Phelps is an adept tattoo artist based in Berkeley, United States, with a distinct proficiency in dotwork and fineline styles. Their professionalism is evident in their clear communication about guest bookings and locations, ensuring clients know when and where to find them for their meticulously hand-poked designs at @modernelectric.ttt. Alex's dedication to artistry is matched by their meticulous attention to detail, both in their work and in maintaining a professional schedule.\nPrice: $\nCurrent location: Berkeley, California, United States\n\n🏳️‍⚧️ Hand poke tattooer\n🥀 Resident artist @thorns.tattoo\n🌁 Now booking: April-May\n💌 Join my email list ⤵️",
